;; 90-docs/business/ad-networks/overseas-publisher-onboarding.edn
;;
;; Overseas ad networks / portals that could put ads on our own properties
;; (web, smartphone, games), what each one requires, and where the
;; registration stands. Owner direction 2026-09-16: 「海外で調査、それぞれ
;; 登録と契約を進めて」.
;;
;; Every :requirement carries its :evidence URL and the date it was read.
;; :verdict compares the requirement with OUR measured numbers
;; (90-docs/business/metrics/*.kotoba, :pageviews-7d as-of 2026-09-04,
;; scaled x4.3 to a month) -- not with hopes. A network whose bar we are
;; under is :not-eligible-yet, and no application is sent to it.
;;
;; Registration status vocabulary:
;;   :researched              facts recorded, nothing sent
;;   :owner-action-required   the next step needs something an agent must not
;;                            do (safety floor: enter credentials / payment /
;;                            tax / ID) or a decision that is the owner's
;;   :application-sent        an application or inquiry was sent (who / when / from)
;;   :approved / :declined    the network answered
;;
;; This file is the current state only (history is git). Third-party
;; networks are leverage 0.4 in ADR-2608096000; they are FILL behind the
;; first-party network (ads.x402.nexus, adr-2609161800), never the primary.

